or\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">override ELEMENT_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override FIRST_SOURCE_INDEX: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"5\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; ranks: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; ids: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"8\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"9\">fn main(@builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3u, @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * DISPATCH_X + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">  if (index &gt;= ELEMENT_COUNT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">  ranks[index] = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">  ids[index] = FIRST_SOURCE_INDEX + index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ranks<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"inverse-distance-weighting-index-ranks-0\">inverse-distance-weighting-index-ranks-0</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>ids<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"inverse-distance-weighting-index-ids-0\">inverse-distance-weighting-index-ids-0</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUGridIndex/initialize-ranks · main · 16f1b549</figcaption></figure></section>",
